# Third-party runtime dependencies of the engine, and of autolister-core.
# `make lock` compiles them, with hashes, into requirements.txt.
#
# Dependencies the services share follow the signer's pins (its web3 5 is the
# pickiest), so one environment can test both against production versions.
-c ../signer/requirements.txt

